{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_049mom0104_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_049mom0104_1000_p", "source_sha256": "65171e1c518d155e1194fc671399ad1664d47e7ce26f79a7a27abb6feca4c639", "ja": "（桃子の声がするから来てみたんだけど……\n熱心に鏡を見ていて、ちっとも気づかないな）", "zh": "（我听到桃子的声音，便过来看看……\n但她正认真盯着镜子，完全没注意到我呢。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_049mom0104_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_049mom0104_1001_049mom", "source_sha256": "389e9bed708db92480871dff184c190fb1eb89c3636e7c9ddb24f6bdf4cd3798", "ja": "フレー、フレー！\n……うーん。ちょっと違うかな。", "zh": "加油～加油～！\n……嗯～好像不太对呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_049mom0104_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_049mom0104_1002_p", "source_sha256": "8095a555fc7c39dd2b6a4877e528be1135bf05cbb7e85c1afb245f62127c484b", "ja": "桃子、何してるんだ？", "zh": "桃子，你在做什么？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_049mom0104_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_049mom0104_1003_049mom", "source_sha256": "25c1228c0fb504e44da47733ba4f9af3feb5d598dc1766fe6bf6f955c6e1d3d0", "ja": "ひゃあっ！？　……お兄ちゃん！？\nもう、びっくりさせないでよね！", "zh": "呀啊！？大哥哥！？\n讨厌，你不要吓桃子啦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_049mom0104_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_049mom0104_1004_p", "source_sha256": "c684a9079c316abd265c4dc2fa2d437870d868975f84a4a14420ade04ba14dd8", "ja": "いや、何度か声は掛けたんだけど……\nところで、何をしてたんだ？", "zh": "不，我已经叫你好几次了……\n话说回来，你在做什么？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_049mom0104_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_049mom0104_1005_049mom", "source_sha256": "77af9b313eca3285aee970bdfd62446e3024f4014e181aa1ef47622e870e31bf", "ja": "何って、別に……ちょっと\n新しい衣装のチェックをしてただけだよ。", "zh": "也没做什么……\n桃子只是在确认新的服装而已。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_049mom0104_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_049mom0104_1006_049mom", "source_sha256": "b882c7696fbb8833e5edf17ddd9ec3e0ea15ed70afa984857b2ecfb1abd79d8f", "ja": "この新しい衣装、カワイイと思うな。\n桃子、けっこう気に入ったかも。", "zh": "这套新服装很可爱，\n桃子还挺满意的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_049mom0104_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_049mom0104_1007_p", "source_sha256": "b0ba2b47006d8e0229332f68b958fc24ce8c83b828cf58a47e07632660b31450", "ja": "おお、そうか！　うん、\n桃子が喜んでくれたなら良かった。", "zh": "喔喔，这样啊！\n嗯，你喜欢就好。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_049mom0104_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_049mom0104_1008_049mom", "source_sha256": "295744671e95a38d8b44fff0f9ac2dfe26e92f4226d7b26790b4c31173cf167d", "ja": "でもお兄ちゃん、これってチアガールでしょ？\n桃子、誰かを応援するんだよね。", "zh": "但是，大哥哥，这是啦啦队的衣服吧？\n桃子要帮别人加油对吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_049mom0104_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_049mom0104_1009_p", "source_sha256": "a9ee10705b2e2f59ace86078139a509843ed7bcdd6bbc4be7287e2b4fee3d1c0", "ja": "そういう事になるかな、チアガールだし。\nどうかしたのか？", "zh": "毕竟是啦啦队，应该就是这样吧。\n怎么了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_049mom0104_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_049mom0104_1010_049mom", "source_sha256": "f898a03ba9121cf3554ccffeaedc776c5f8c6047ea6f0738b6bdb8c234b71dbf", "ja": "ううん。ただ、桃子はアイドルだから……\nフツウ、アイドルは応援される側じゃない？", "zh": "没什么，只是因为桃子是偶像……\n一般来说应该是别人帮桃子加油才对吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_049mom0104_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_049mom0104_1011_049mom", "source_sha256": "8307a9ab77dbfdc7fd905f527e5e2d41b57dce3a5454c5ba84108e2490a4d3e5", "ja": "それにポンポンとか持って応援するのって、\nなんだか子どもっぽくない？", "zh": "而且要拿着彩球加油，\n感觉很孩子气耶～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_049mom0104_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_049mom0104_1012_p", "source_sha256": "699f9d22640726ea892590ef8e41953c1fdd5237c3dca340c07112e55fcadfca", "ja": "そんな事はないと思うけど……それにファンの人達は\n日頃、アイドルを見て励まされてるんじゃないかな？", "zh": "我是不觉得啦……\n而且粉丝平常看到偶像不是都会觉得受到激励吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_049mom0104_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_049mom0104_1013_p", "source_sha256": "19d20731ceed95aa70d22b125497db33f0be34bc49f92683155397a94209720c", "ja": "だから桃子がチアガールでも、全然おかしくないと\n思うよ。むしろ、ぴったりだと思う！", "zh": "所以我觉得桃子当啦啦队一点也不奇怪喔，\n反而相当适合呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_049mom0104_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_049mom0104_1014_049mom", "source_sha256": "0448b67490537431a0ef4f3e05747be557a3b74fc11646e6db5e84e4856c1d6e", "ja": "そ、そうかな……。\nお兄ちゃん、適当なこと言ってない？", "zh": "是、是吗……\n大哥哥，你不是在乱说话哄桃子吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_049mom0104_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_049mom0104_1015_049mom", "source_sha256": "d391e56a49477b849f07e841cd3067298aa222e00d5d3c657a90c0cf55bced15", "ja": "まあでも……アイドルがファンの人を励ます、だっけ。\nそれは、お兄ちゃんの言うとおりかも……うん。", "zh": "不过……偶像会激励粉丝啊……\n这句话大哥哥可能说得没错……嗯。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_049mom0104_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_049mom0104_1016_049mom", "source_sha256": "14cabd3cf6f157d8cefd01602d9f973620a5855af4e1c701cf69a3de60375de6", "ja": "桃子ががんばってるのを見て元気が出るなら、\n応援されたら、もっと元気が出るってことだよね？", "zh": "如果看桃子努力的样子能打起精神，\n那要是桃子为粉丝加油，大家应该更加精神百倍吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_049mom0104_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_049mom0104_1017_p", "source_sha256": "ba1ecea75abb4de4fa06f753d4a9cfde4f6eb0da921b73dc4cf892f4de7c490f", "ja": "そういう事だ！\nよし、今から応援の練習をしてみよう。できるか？", "zh": "就是这样！\n好，现在就开始练习如何帮人加油吧，可以吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_049mom0104_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_049mom0104_1018_049mom", "source_sha256": "bcb18857b8a352e9b763b0364febd589d5b69833d2dbc00e345b562215625598", "ja": "えっ……そ、それは、できるけど……。\n……ホントに？", "zh": "咦……可、可以是可以啦……\n……真的要吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_049mom0104_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_049mom0104_1019_p", "source_sha256": "e61cd50468657e0ef69112c71d95bc71e4b1445682cb118fccd3c358e892c91f", "ja": "ああ。俺を桃子のファンのみんなだと思って、\n思いっきり応援するんだ。せーの！", "zh": "对啊，就把我当成桃子的粉丝，\n尽情帮我加油吧，预备！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_049mom0104_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_049mom0104_1020_049mom", "source_sha256": "2aed14119f1bb83d1ef8d3de0787396fb7a298d1e4ac081d31aa16fe39556a1e", "ja": "ふ……フレー、フレー！　お兄ちゃん！\nがんばれ！　がんばれ！　お兄ちゃん！", "zh": "冲……冲吧！冲吧！大哥哥！\n加油！加油！大哥哥！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_049mom0104_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_049mom0104_1021_049mom", "source_sha256": "c611ae987bbbcdddb5133d45a850d933f6116f6348f0a8a9898f8555d9edc645", "ja": "お兄ちゃん、いつもありがとー！\n桃子もお兄ちゃんのこと、応援してるから！", "zh": "大哥哥，谢谢你平常的照顾──！\n桃子也会为大哥哥加油的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_049mom0104_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_049mom0104_1022_049mom", "source_sha256": "4c1c969ed983ea3a29131a8f6d85ab306f414c046ddb1c793adf4d0a65f7f9cd", "ja": "ふう……。\nえっと、こんな感じでどうかな……？", "zh": "呼……\n呃，刚刚那样如何……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_049mom0104_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_049mom0104_1023_p", "source_sha256": "71fd5ae54f3d534c1181cface4d88dc852b53832f5859f647ca86b23d6aedd75", "ja": "おお、いいじゃないか！\n桃子の応援したい気持ち、伝わってきたぞ！", "zh": "喔喔，很不错嘛！\n感受到桃子想鼓舞人的心意了喔！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_049mom0104_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_049mom0104_1024_049mom", "source_sha256": "434b5f189c3db0ead5319badcbb44591893b2fa03a72923db13cf41e8abe6a2d", "ja": "ま、まあ、桃子は女優だから。\nこれくらい、できて当然だよね。", "zh": "毕、毕竟桃子是演员嘛，\n这点表现也是应该的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_049mom0104_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_049mom0104_1025_049mom", "source_sha256": "c9f6a687c0c06384de99ee28e4e4372708834c267b66d0df4121a01b50818d57", "ja": "チアガール、ちょっと楽しいね。お兄ちゃん、\n今度はこういうお仕事も取ってきていいからね♪", "zh": "当啦啦队好像有点有趣呢。\n大哥哥，下次可以再接这种工作喔♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
